; woods_deep.room - the deep woods: giant trunks and branch ledges over a root mound (design 04 section 3.4).
; Gates: the canopy opening (cols 48-55) is 7 rows above the row-4 branch (double jump); the hole to the root
; caves sits in a pocket past a water pit under a low stone ceiling (Enraizar bridge, earth banks cols 32/40).

[room]
origin = 0, 0
tileset = spring_woods

